OL,3,ANew Nvidia boss says 'ambition has
OL,4,Anever been greater' after Jensen
OL,5,AHuang's exit
OL,6,
OL,7,FNvidia's interim chief executive
OL,8,FCollette Kress said the company's rapid
OL,9,Fgrowth remains on track despite the
OL,10,Fdramatic exit of founder Jensen Huang.
OL,12,FIn her first public comments since
OL,13,FHuang plunged the multi-trillion dollar
OL,14,Fchip manufacturer into chaos, Kress
OL,15,Fsaid Nvidia's "roadmap is on track and
OL,16,Four ambition has never been greater".
OL,18,FThe company's quarterly sales doubled
OL,19,Ffrom a year earlier, topping $100bn for
OL,20,Fthe first time, with shares in the
OL,21,Fcompany climbing in after-hours
OL,22,Ftrading.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
FL,107,105,200,160,0,100
