OL,3,ANew Nvidia boss says 'ambition has
OL,4,Anever been greater' after Jensen
OL,5,AHuang's exit
OL,6,
OL,7,FEarlier on Tuesday Huang said he would
OL,8,Fbe "honoured" to return and lead
OL,9,FNvidia, having quit following two
OL,10,Falleged extramarital affairs, including
OL,11,Fone with a possible spy for China.
